From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: rockchip-vpu: Add RK3528 VPU

The RK3528 carries the RK3568's VDPU2, with a lower VP8 limit: add its
compatible, falling back to the RK3568's.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rockchip-vpu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rockchip-vpu.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rockchip-vpu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rockchip-vpu.yaml
@@ -33,7 +33,9 @@ properties:
           - const: rockchip,rk3228-vpu
           - const: rockchip,rk3399-vpu
       - items:
-          - const: rockchip,rk3588-vpu121
+          - enum:
+              - rockchip,rk3528-vpu
+              - rockchip,rk3588-vpu121
           - const: rockchip,rk3568-vpu
 
   reg:
